{"881940":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Guns 'n Goblins","steam_appid":881940,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE THE LAST BELL RINGER<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/881940\/extras\/204944f371ecb7384258f92876e59dea.poster.avif?t=1791879308\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/881940\/extras\/204944f371ecb7384258f92876e59dea.webm?t=1791879308\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/881940\/extras\/204944f371ecb7384258f92876e59dea.mp4?t=1791879308\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“With every rising moon, tides of monsters wash over the land. <\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Long ago, a king constructed the Bell Bastions to draw these hordes away from the defenseless. <\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>That kingdom has since fallen to ruin, but one single Bastion still stands.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are the last Bell Ringer.<\/i><br><i>And this is your first night.”<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CALL MASSIVE SWARMS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/881940\/extras\/51446cbe2d338f737a9ed964a14576ca.poster.avif?t=1791879308\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/881940\/extras\/51446cbe2d338f737a9ed964a14576ca.webm?t=1791879308\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/881940\/extras\/51446cbe2d338f737a9ed964a14576ca.mp4?t=1791879308\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>torrents of creatures thousands strong<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the horde:<\/strong> Ring the bell as often as you dare to call a deluge of monsters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push your limits<\/strong> to reap even more rewards: XP, gold, and resources<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLEASH YOUR FIREPOWER <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/881940\/extras\/fe3ee4b09ea6b9cee960fb19866ba08e.poster.avif?t=1791879308\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/881940\/extras\/fe3ee4b09ea6b9cee960fb19866ba08e.webm?t=1791879308\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/881940\/extras\/fe3ee4b09ea6b9cee960fb19866ba08e.mp4?t=1791879308\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to max out your <strong>stats and<\/strong> <strong>passive perks<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons and <strong>upgrade them<\/strong> to reach even deadlier heights<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With each death, your strength grows<\/strong>: rise from Apprentice Bell Ringer to Master Dragon Hunter<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REBUILD THE BASTION<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\